<view class="city-page">
  <view class="safe-area" style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px"></view>
  <view class="city-nav">
    <button class="nav-back" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回">‹</button>
    <text class="nav-title">Edit Profile</text>
    <button class="nav-options" bindtap="showCityInfo" aria-label="城市选择说明">···</button>
    <button class="nav-profile" bindtap="goProfile" aria-label="前往我的页面">♙</button>
  </view>
  <view class="city-content">
    <view class="search-wrap">
      <text class="search-icon">⌕</text>
      <input class="search-input" placeholder="搜索城市名称 / 拼音 (如: beijing, 成都)" value="{{query}}" focus="{{searchFocused}}" bindinput="search" />
      <button wx:if="{{query}}" class="search-clear" bindtap="clearSearch" aria-label="清空搜索">×</button>
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{!query}}">
      <view class="current-card">
        <view class="current-heading"><text class="location-mark">⌖</text><text>当前浏览城市</text><button class="relocate-hint" bindtap="locationHint">↻ 位置说明</button></view>
        <view class="current-main"><text class="current-name">{{currentCity}}</text><text class="selected-tag">手动选择</text><text class="current-pin">⌖</text></view>
        <view class="current-help"><text class="green-dot"></text>您选择的城市仅用于本机浏览；活动地点以详情为准</view>
      </view>
      <view class="city-tip"><view class="tip-orb">✧</view><view class="tip-copy"><view class="tip-title">IRL 城市浏览 <text class="tip-badge">R1</text></view><view class="tip-caption">当前以邀请参与活动，公开同城找局尚未开放</view></view><text class="tip-arrow">›</text></view>
      <view class="section-heading"><text>热门活动枢纽</text><text class="section-hint">常用城市</text></view>
      <view class="popular-grid"><button wx:for="{{popularCities}}" wx:key="*this" class="popular {{currentCity === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-city="{{item}}" bindtap="selectCity">{{item}}<text wx:if="{{currentCity === item}}" class="selected-corner"></text></button></view>
    </block>

    <view class="section-heading list-heading"><text>{{query ? '搜索结果' : '全部城市列表'}}</text><text class="section-hint">{{query ? visibleCities.length + ' 个城市' : '拼音检索排序'}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{visibleCities.length === 0}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-icon">⌖</text><view>未找到相关城市</view><text>支持汉字或全拼检索，例：“成”或“chengdu”</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{query && visibleCities.length > 0}}" class="search-results"><button wx:for="{{visibleCities}}" wx:key="name" class="city-row" data-city="{{item.name}}" bindtap="selectCity"><text class="search-city-name">⌖　{{item.name}}</text><text class="province">{{item.pinyin}}</text></button></view>
    <block wx:if="{{!query}}">
      <view wx:for="{{cityGroups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="letter" class="city-group" id="city-group-{{group.letter}}">
        <view class="group-letter">{{group.letter}}</view>
        <button wx:for="{{group.items}}" wx:for-item="city" wx:key="name" class="city-row" data-city="{{city.name}}" bindtap="selectCity"><view class="city-label"><text class="city-name">{{city.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{city.badge}}" class="city-badge {{city.name === '成都' ? 'lime' : ''}}">{{city.badge}}</text><text wx:if="{{currentCity === city.name}}" class="city-check">✓</text></view><text class="province {{currentCity === city.name ? 'selected' : ''}}">{{currentCity === city.name ? '当前已选' : city.province}}</text></button>
      </view>
      <view class="missing-city"><view class="missing-icon">◎</view><view class="missing-title">找不到您的城市?</view><view class="missing-copy">还可搜索更多城市；当前活动仍以邀请参与，城市选择仅保存本机浏览偏好。</view><button bindtap="searchMoreCities">⌕ 搜索更多城市</button></view>
    </block>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!query}}" class="alphabet-rail"><button wx:for="{{letters}}" wx:key="*this" data-letter="{{item}}" bindtap="jumpToLetter">{{item}}</button></view>
</view>
